      "act": "BLUF",
      "role_note": "EXECUTIVE-SUMMARY LAW; misconception: accepting a document = using it.",
      "narration_text": "The easy answer is to give the AI the whole document. It will accept it. But accepting a document isn't the same as reasoning over it.",
